  "basis": "Criteria from van Oorschot (2000, 2006). Structure (a favourable and an unfavourable list per criterion) follows De Coninck and Steeman (2026, Journalism & Mass Communication Quarterly), whose lists were written for Belgian newspapers in Dutch and French. The terms here were chosen for United States coverage of the Afrikaner resettlement programme and Operation PARRIS and are not a translation of theirs.",
